# Central Activity Log + Email Queue

## Principle — OUR DB is source of truth
Every OMS event inserts into Postgres `CommunicationLog` first.
**Activity & History UI reads ONLY `CommunicationLog`.**

### Field updates (EDD / payment / tracking / contact / address / etc.)
Always logged to `CommunicationLog` with `sentBy` (who changed it) + old/new in metadata/body.
Dashboard hides `*_update` / `system_event` rows for now (`SHOW_FIELD_CHANGE_LOGS = false`
in `NotesPanel.tsx`). Flip to `true` later to show full audit in UI.
Staff notes + emails always visible.

EDD/Tracking/payment/supplier saves: update fields + Activity Log only —
**never** append system “notes” that sync to Monday Updates.

## Staff notes — opt-in sync
Note modal (Internal note tab) checkboxes:
- ☐ Send to Monday.com → Monday Update only if checked
- ☐ Send to Cin7 → Coming Soon (disabled in UI)
- ☐ Add to Shopify order timeline → opt-in staff note on Shopify order

Customer email tab: subject + body → email **queue** (not internal note sync).

## Customer email — QUEUE ONLY, CRON SENDS
**Rule:** Button clicks / API saves **never send email**. They only enqueue.

1. `enqueueCustomerEmails` / `enqueueLineItemCustomerNotify`
   → `BulkEmailJob` + `BulkEmailRecipient` (subject/body on job)
   → `CommunicationLog` pending (“Email Queued”)
2. **Only** `/api/bulk-notify/process` (Vercel Cron / `CRON_SECRET`) sends
3. `finalizeQueuedEmailLog` → sent / failed

### Entry points (all enqueue, none send)
- Bulk Actions Customer Email
- `/api/bulk-notify`
- Note modal Customer email tab (`noteRole: customer` + `notifySubject`)
- EDD save with `notifyCustomer: true` + `notifyKind: edd`
- Tracking save with `notifyCustomer: true` + `notifyKind: tracking`

### UI
- Queue chip polls **status only** (GET) — must **not** POST process to send
- Vercel Cron: `* * * * *` → GET `/api/bulk-notify/process` with `CRON_SECRET`
- Provider: Resend / SMTP (`email-providers.server.ts`) — not Shopify marketing

Helper: `app/lib/email-queue.server.ts`

## Phase split (notifications product)
- **Launch:** plain queue email + bulk field updates + log
- **Next phase:** rich text editor, templates, preview/test send, auto workflows,
  one combined email per customer when multiple lines affected
